<title>DENMARK: Novo Nordisk in U.S. research deal.</title>
<headline>Novo Nordisk in U.S. research deal.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish biotechnology and pharmaceuticals group Novo Nordisk said on Wednesday it signed a drug research collaboration deal with U.S. Dyax Corporation.</p>
<p>It said that the deal embraced the establishment of cooperation to develop new research tools to allow more rapid evaluation of therapeutic drug candidates for development by Novo Nordisk using Dyax phage display technology.</p>
<p>No financial details were disclosed but Novo Nordisk said the collaboration pact with Cambridge, Massachusetts-based Dyax was scheduled to last two years.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33969652</p>
